Going back to this, I think that djuno requires a metaphysics by which x1
could conclude that x2 is true.  Since the metaphysics is not stated or
even statable in the place structure, then it would not count as djuno
only if there existed NO metaphysics consistent with the other elements.
But we are now in the epicycles within epicycles, and I am not sure that
I can conceive of an x1-dependent metaphysics that would generate truths
that x1 would consider false (or flasehoods that x1 would consider true).

